# {{.Type}} {{.Name}}

Authoritatively manages every privilege grant on one Spanner table, as part of
[fine-grained access control (FGAC)](https://cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/fgac-about). The
`grant` blocks are the complete set of table-level privileges on the table: on every apply, any
grant not listed is revoked and any listed grant that's missing is granted. Valid privileges are
`SELECT`, `INSERT`, `UPDATE` and `DELETE` (uppercase); each role may appear in only one `grant`
block.

~> **Warning:** This resource owns *every* grant on the table. Grants created outside Terraform,
grants managed by `spanner_grant` resources on the same table, and all column-level grants on the
table are revoked on apply. Destroying this resource revokes every grant on the table, from every
role. Don't combine it with `spanner_grant` resources targeting the same table.

Changing `table` or `schema` forces replacement. If the table is dropped outside Terraform, the
resource is removed from state on the next refresh.

